OL,3,GNEWSA'We all need data, but do we need
OL,4,Athe largest data centre in Europe
OL,5,Ahere?'
OL,6,
OL,7,FNorth Ockendon in Havering, east
OL,8,FLondon, is right in the middle of
OL,9,FLondon's green belt on the edge of the
OL,10,Fcapital. But it might not be green belt
OL,11,Ffor much longer if developers have
OL,12,Ftheir way.
OL,14,FThese fields are the proposed site for
OL,15,Fa huge data centre campus - one of the
OL,16,Flargest in Europe.
OL,18,FDevelopers Digital Reef say it would
OL,19,Fcreate jobs and be the most sustainable
OL,20,Fin the world, but the locals don't want
OL,21,Fit and say it would destroy their
OL,22,Flives.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
