OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'We all need data, but do we need
OL,4,Athe largest data centre in Europe
OL,5,Ahere?'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnd this development shows the dilemma
OL,8,Fand many of the issues around data
OL,9,Fcentres. They are necessary for much of
OL,10,Fmodern life. But where do you put them
OL,11,Fand at what cost?
